2026-06-08 17:47:38,785 - INFO - 🔍 ADK Webhook [BEFORE_TOOL]: Executing 'set_model_response' with args: {"summaries": [{"name": "Adams Hotel", "reviews_summary": "Guests praise Adams Hotel for its outstanding location in the Plaka neighborhood of Athens, just a short walk from the Acropolis entrance, restaurants, and shops. The family room options, which include bunk beds for children and a mini-fridge, are highly appreciated. While the rooms and bathrooms can be quite small, and some guests noted basic breakfasts or spotty Wi-Fi, the friendly staff and scenic roof terrace with Acropolis views make it a highly valued budget-friendly base.", "key_highlights": ["Unbeatable location in Plaka, within a 5-minute walk to the Acropolis entrance.", "Family-friendly room layout options featuring bunk beds for children.", "Lovely rooftop terrace offering spectacular views of the Acropolis.", "Helpful and friendly staff who assist with parking and area recommendations."], "average_rating": 4.1, "place_id": "ChIJJ6iQRRa9oRQRX961I9bkC7o", "suitability_analysis": "Highly suitable for a family trip focused on sightseeing in Athens. Its prime location in Plaka minimizes walking distances to historic sites for children, and the availability of dedicated family rooms with bunk beds provides a comfortable, cost-effective setup. However, families should prepare for compact room dimensions, a basic breakfast, and potential spotty Wi-Fi in the rooms."}, {"name": "El Greco Resort & Spa", "reviews_summary": "El Greco Resort & Spa is widely recognized for its beautiful grounds, featuring multiple well-maintained swimming pools, beautiful plants, and comfortable, spacious rooms that accommodate families of four easily. Located on a cliffside, it is a convenient 7 to 8-minute walk to Fira town center, making dining and shopping very accessible. Reviews are slightly mixed regarding the basic breakfast quality, the unheated temperature of the pools, and occasionally blunt reception staff, but the accommodating nature of the team during medical situations and the great location shine through.", "key_highlights": ["Spacious, clean, and well-furnished rooms capable of comfortably hosting four guests.", "Multiple beautifully maintained swimming pools throughout the resort.", "Convenient location only an 8-minute walk to the shops and caldera views of Fira.", "Caring staff response during emergencies and an elegant on-site spa."], "average_rating": 4.6, "place_id": "ChIJzSc5TdbNmRQR-yA73uzAVBc", "suitability_analysis": "Moderately to highly suitable for families, particularly those with older kids or teenagers who can navigate the walking distance into Fira and enjoy the multiple on-site swimming pools. The spacious rooms are a big plus for family sharing. However, it may not be ideal for families seeking direct beach access (which is on the opposite side of the island) or those traveling with very young toddlers, as pools are unheated and the resort layout requires a fair amount of walking."}, {"suitability_analysis": "Perfectly and exceptionally suitable for a family-friendly trip. As an all-inclusive resort dedicated to families, it excels in kids' entertainment, diverse and child-friendly food choices, safety, and excellent service. The resort takes the stress out of family travel by providing beachfront access, multiple restaurants, a 24-hour gym, and high-quality staff who actively look out for guests' well-being. It is the definitive top recommendation for this trip style.", "average_rating": 4.6, "key_highlights": ["Superb entertainment program and activities tailored specifically for children.", "Excellent all-inclusive dining with three high-quality restaurants and daily themed buffets.", "Warm, exceptionally caring staff who show immediate support in emergencies.", "Modern, clean, and highly comfortable rooms ideal for family stays."], "place_id": "ChIJSS3PLgOAmxQRK9UVfLzVgTQ", "reviews_summary": "Kiani Beach Resort receives glowing praise for its vibrant, highly welcoming, and family-centric atmosphere. Guests rave about the top-tier dining, featuring three distinct restaurants (including themed buffet nights and delicious options like hand-stretched pizzas and beachside pancakes), overseen by an attentive executive chef. The entertainment program for both kids and adults is highly engaging, the staff (including restaurant and reception personnel) are extremely polite and helpful, and the accommodations are modern, clean, and fresh. Even non-hotel guests highly recommend their premium spa treatments.", "name": "Kiani Beach Resort Family All Inclusive"}]}
